    "body": "I've changed them to your respective suggestions but how do you think we should compress the log files?\r\nBecause we can't just compress all logs that are not our session (e.g. from an old session) because we can have multiple sessions open at the same time.\r\nAnd compressing our own file does not make much sense to me because we would have to uncompress and recompress the log file every starship invocation which could potentially take quite long.",
    "created_at": "2020-08-13T06:24:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-09-28T19:03:31Z",
    "html_url": "https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/1576#discussion_r469723290",
